  "notes": [
    "**Dejar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Multiple meanings depending on context:",
    "**Dejar** = to leave (something/someone)",
    "**Dejar de + infinitive** = to stop doing something, to quit",
    "Common usage:",
    "*Dejé el libro en la mesa* (I left the book on the table)",
    "*Dejé de fumar* (I quit smoking / I stopped smoking)",
    "*Dejar en paz* (to leave alone)",
    "**Dejar de** is always followed by an infinitive when it means \"to stop\""
  ],
